--- transform -- list transform ops for the handl runtime.
---
--- Single source of truth for the `transform` interface: list-to-list and
--- fold operations (`map`, `filter`, `reduce`). The canonical pure-handl
--- implementations live alongside this contract in `map.hnl`,
--- `filter.hnl`, and `reduce.hnl`, loaded per-file by `kit-canonical`'s
--- `TransformModule`. Kits without the canonical wiring (e.g. those using
--- `plugin-lib-utils`) register the native `rust_fn_*` handls declared
--- below instead.
---
--- ## Capability declarations (ADR-0077 Phase 4)
--- transform.map -- map a function over a list.
--- transform.filter -- filter a list by a predicate.
--- transform.reduce -- fold a list with a function and an initial value.
cap "transform.map"
cap "transform.filter"
cap "transform.reduce"
op "transform.map" : (Value * Value) -> Value

op "transform.filter" : (Value * Value) -> Value

op "transform.reduce" : (Value * Value * Value) -> Value

handle "transform.map" with rust_fn_map
handle "transform.filter" with rust_fn_filter
handle "transform.reduce" with rust_fn_reduce
